-- Result equivalence: optimizer ON must produce same results as optimizer OFF.
-- Each pair of queries (OFF then ON) must show identical data rows.

-- Tests 1+2: GROUP BY + COUNT
-- Both OFF and ON must show A=3, B=2, C=1
A        |   3
B        |   2
C        |   1
A        |   3
B        |   2
C        |   1

